error.description:
## Active document does not match the current AYON context
{msg}
**AYON context:** {folder_path} / {task_name}
**Expected work root:** {expected_work_root}
**Active document directory:** {current_dir}
### Why does this happen?
When you open a Photoshop document directly (not through the AYON tools), the AYON session context is not updated. If you then publish, outputs would be filed under the wrong folder or task.
### How to fix?
{repair_msg}
If you changed context via the Ayon tools but are still seeing this error, close and reopen the correct workfile from Ayon to refresh the session context.
(Context = combination of project, folder path and task name.)
